FOLDER: 005-labeling
SYSTEM: MareNostrum 5 — glogin1
CREATED: 12/06/2026
UPDATED: 12/06/2026
PURPOSE: CP2K DFT labeling of 385 candidate structures selected from
         ArcaNN iteration 005 exploration for all 4 molecular systems.
=====================================

12/06/2026

o Folder initialized by running 'arcann_training labeling prepare' from glogin1. The
  parameter list file 'job-array-params_CP2K_label_cpu_glogin1.lst' was generated with
  385 entries covering 4 systems: ppimg2-hydrolysis (175), ppimg2-TS (207),
  ppimg2-prod (2) and ppimg2-react (1). Each calculation uses 1 node, 10 MPI ranks
  and a two-step SCF scheme (0.5 h + 0.5 h walltime).

o CP2K jobs submitted as SLURM job arrays on the gpp partition (qos gp_resa). The
  hydrolysis (175), prod (2) and react (1) systems and the first 151 TS structures
  (tasks 0-150) were launched manually. The remaining 56 TS tasks (151-206) were
  submitted as job 41679731 once sufficient queue capacity was available, using
  'sbatch --array=151-206%300 job-array_CP2K_label_cpu_glogin1_0.sh'.

o All 385 CP2K calculations completed successfully: 350 output files for
  ppimg2-hydrolysis, 4 for ppimg2-prod, 2 for ppimg2-react and 414 for ppimg2-TS
  (2 output files per structure). Zero skipped or unconverged structures.

o Ran 'arcann_training labeling check': all 4 systems passed without errors.
  'is_checked' flag confirmed in 'control/labeling_005.json'.

o Ran 'arcann_training labeling extract': DFT energies, forces and virial tensors
  extracted for all 385 structures and written to the training dataset. 'is_extracted'
  flag confirmed. Clean phase skipped as planned.
